sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Operator SQL repair
    participant W as Usage worker / closing
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    Note over O,D: Row selector: customer_billing_state.customer_id = C<br/>Event row: usage_inbox.source = S and usage_inbox.event_id = E<br/>Catalog advisory (65102, 2): protects price_versions, not a column
    Note over O,D: Repair follows the documented controlled SQL procedure.<br/>The investigated usage_inbox row is quarantined, not financially pending.
    O->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
    O->>D: Exclusive catalog advisory lock
    W->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
    Note over W,D: WAIT on the investigated customer's account
    Note over O,D: A worker for another customer may hold a shared catalog lock.<br/>The repair then waits for that worker to commit.
    O->>D: Insert historical price<br/>Revalidate affected rated history across the metric
    alt Repair would change rated history
        O->>D: ROLLBACK price and any release
        D-->>W: Account released, usage_inbox row remains quarantined
    else Repair preserves history
        O->>D: UPDATE only the investigated processing_error to NULL
        O->>D: COMMIT catalog change and usage_inbox row release together
        D-->>W: Account lock granted
        alt Waiting operation is invoice closing
            W->>D: Publish already processed groups only, COMMIT
            Note over W,D: Released pending usage_inbox row still does not block closing
        else Waiting worker selected another pending usage_inbox row
            W->>D: Shared catalog lock, FOR UPDATE<br/>usage_inbox.source = S<br/>usage_inbox.event_id = E<br/>Read new price and committed closure state
            W->>D: Account once into an eligible billing_month, COMMIT
        end
        W->>D: A later poll selects the investigated released usage_inbox row
        W->>D: BEGIN, account lock, shared catalog, usage_inbox row lock<br/>Rate with repaired price and current closure state
        W->>D: Commit this usage_inbox row and its financial effects together
    end
    Note over W,D: A quarantined usage_inbox row is excluded from candidate polling.<br/>Only a poll after release can newly select that usage_inbox row.<br/>Issued invoices are never rewritten by repair.
